<title>GERMANY: German 1996 rapeseed crop 37 pct lower - ministry.</title>
<headline>German 1996 rapeseed crop 37 pct lower - ministry.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's 1996 rapeseed crop dropped sharply to 1.95 million tonnes compared with 3.11 million last year, the Bonn farm ministry said in a press release, citing federal statistics office data.</p>
<p>The ministry said losses were due to damage from the severe 1995/96 winter.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
